        "Puppy's First Groom",
        "A gentle, low-pressure introduction to grooming with lots of treats and cuddles, so future visits are stress-free.",
        "Hand Stripping",
        "Traditional hand-stripping for wire-coated breeds like Terriers and Schnauzers, keeping coats healthy and textured.",
        "Nail Trim & Tidy",
